282	39	40	6000000001287239	[Uni - Jan till Jun 2027] AI Engineer Intern	Singapore, sg	\N	https://api.smartrecruiters.com/v1/companies/NCS3/postings/6000000001287239	active	\N	2026-09-24 16:35:52.306886+08	2026-09-24 16:35:52.306886+08	2026-09-29 01:14:57.823611+08	2026-10-13 22:25:58.672036+08	As an AI Engineer Intern, you'll get hands-on experience building and improving real components of an enterprise-grade AI platform: intelligent routing between AI models, cost and usage optimisation tooling, guardrails and safety systems, and the tooling that helps teams go from an idea to a governed, deployed agent quickly. This is a live, evolving platform already being used to solve real operational challenges for enterprise customers — so you'll be contributing to something with genuine impact, not a sandbox exercise. You'll gain exposure to agentic AI architectures, responsible-AI design patterns, and the practical realities of operating AI safely and reliably at enterprise scale — a strong foundation whether you're headed toward AI infrastructure, applied ML engineering, or platform engineering roles after graduation. What You’ll Do: As an AI Engineer Intern, you'll work alongside and support our AI Engineers on real, active components of this platform — helping with implementation, testing, and day-to-day engineering tasks under their guidance. This is a hands-on learning opportunity: you won't be expected to work independently on complex problems, but you will be contributing to genuine, in-use platform work, gaining practical experience you won't get from coursework or personal projects alone. Key Responsibilities Technical Skills Write and debug code (primarily Python, or other languages as needed) under the direction of an AI Engineer, following existing patterns and codebase conventions. Build a working understanding of core AI/ML concepts used on the platform — large language models, retrieval-augmented generation, and agentic workflows — enough to contribute to and reason about the code you're working on. Assist with testing, bug fixes, and small feature implementations assigned by your supervising engineer. Learn to use the team's tools, frameworks, and internal systems, asking questions and seeking guidance as needed. Steadily build confidence and independence in your technical work over the course of the internship. Project Delivery Complete clearly scoped tasks assigned by an AI Engineer, checking in regularly on progress and blockers. Support the team in breaking down larger pieces of work into smaller tasks you can take on. Communicate honestly and early when something isn't working or you're stuck — asking for help is expected and encouraged. Keep simple documentation or notes on what you've built, so your supervising engineer can review and build on it. Work within agreed timelines, with support from your team to reprioritise when needed. Role Flexibility Be open to working on different parts of the platform — backend logic, testing, tooling, documentation — depending on what the team needs support with. Adapt as priorities shift, since you'll often be picking up tasks that free up time for the AI Engineers you're supporting. Help with day-to-day tasks like preparing demos, organising test cases, or tidying up documentation, in addition to core engineering work. Bring curiosity and a willingness to learn — this role is about growing your skills while providing real, useful support to the team.\n\nProficiency or willingness to learn programming/scripting languages (e.g. Python, SQL, JavaScript). Basic understanding of AI/ML concepts (e.g. large language models, APIs) or strong willingness to learn. Strong analytical and problem-solving skills. Ability to work collaboratively with cross-functional engineering teams. Familiarity with version control (e.g. Git), basic software engineering practices, and observability tooling (e.g. OpenTelemetry/OTel) is a plus. This internship is ideal for a candidate interested in building hands-on AI engineering experience, contributing to a real enterprise AI platform, and learning directly from experienced AI Engineers.\n\nWe are driven by our AEIOU beliefs—Adventure, Excellence, Integrity, Ownership, and Unity—and we seek individuals who embody these values in both their professional and personal lives. We are committed to our Impact: Valuing our clients, Growing our people, and Creating our future. Together, we make the extraordinary happen. Learn more about us at ncs.co and visit our LinkedIn career site. Scam Alert We are aware of fraudulent job offers and impersonations of NCS recruiters. Phishing emails using convincing-looking but fake addresses are also commonly used to trick you into thinking that they come from official NCS sources. Please note that all official communications from NCS Group will only be sent from verified corporate email addresses. Always check that the sender’s email address ends with the genuine NCS domain, @ncs.com.sg and beware of extra letters, symbols or misspellings. When in doubt, verify the sender’s identity by contacting us at reachus@ncs.com.sg.	52749289f81210612073f02b67e25906c3aec809016add99c616f9897cb42ae5	{"id": "6000000001287239", "name": "[Uni - Jan till Jun 2027] AI Engineer Intern", "uuid": "4522844c-7ed4-4f54-ac5b-98d4165f2492", "jobAd": {"sections": {"jobDescription": {"text": "<p>As an AI Engineer Intern, you'll get hands-on experience building and improving real components of an enterprise-grade AI platform: intelligent routing between AI models, cost and usage optimisation tooling, guardrails and safety systems, and the tooling that helps teams go from an idea to a governed, deployed agent quickly.</p><p>This is a live, evolving platform already being used to solve real operational challenges for enterprise customers — so you'll be contributing to something with genuine impact, not a sandbox exercise.</p><p>You'll gain exposure to agentic AI architectures, responsible-AI design patterns, and the practical realities of operating AI safely and reliably at enterprise scale — a strong foundation whether you're headed toward AI infrastructure, applied ML engineering, or platform engineering roles after graduation.</p><p><strong>What You’ll Do:</strong><br>\\nAs an AI Engineer Intern, you'll work alongside and support our AI Engineers on real, active components of this platform — helping with implementation, testing, and day-to-day engineering tasks under their guidance.</p><p>This is a hands-on learning opportunity: you won't be expected to work independently on complex problems, but you will be contributing to genuine, in-use platform work, gaining practical experience you won't get from coursework or personal projects alone.</p><p>Key Responsibilities</p><p>Technical Skills</p><ul><li>Write and debug code (primarily Python, or other languages as needed) under the direction of an AI Engineer, following existing patterns and codebase conventions.</li><li>Build a working understanding of core AI/ML concepts used on the platform — large language models, retrieval-augmented generation, and agentic workflows — enough to contribute to and reason about the code you're working on.</li><li>Assist with testing, bug fixes, and small feature implementations assigned by your supervising engineer.</li><li>Learn to use the team's tools, frameworks, and internal systems, asking questions and seeking guidance as needed.</li><li>Steadily build confidence and independence in your technical work over the course of the internship.</li></ul><p>Project Delivery</p><ul><li>Complete clearly scoped tasks assigned by an AI Engineer, checking in regularly on progress and blockers.</li><li>Support the team in breaking down larger pieces of work into smaller tasks you can take on.</li><li>Communicate honestly and early when something isn't working or you're stuck — asking for help is expected and encouraged.</li><li>Keep simple documentation or notes on what you've built, so your supervising engineer can review and build on it.</li><li>Work within agreed timelines, with support from your team to reprioritise when needed.</li></ul><p>Role Flexibility</p><ul><li>Be open to working on different parts of the platform — backend logic, testing, tooling, documentation — depending on what the team needs support with.</li><li>Adapt as priorities shift, since you'll often be picking up tasks that free up time for the AI Engineers you're supporting.</li><li>Help with day-to-day tasks like preparing demos, organising test cases, or tidying up documentation, in addition to core engineering work.</li><li>Bring curiosity and a willingness to learn — this role is about growing your skills while providing real, useful support to the team.</li></ul>", "title": "Job Description"}, "qualifications": {"text": "<ul><li>Proficiency or willingness to learn programming/scripting languages (e.g. Python, SQL, JavaScript).</li><li>Basic understanding of AI/ML concepts (e.g. large language models, APIs) or strong willingness to learn.</li><li>Strong analytical and problem-solving skills.</li><li>Ability to work collaboratively with cross-functional engineering teams.</li><li>Familiarity with version control (e.g. Git), basic software engineering practices, and observability tooling (e.g. OpenTelemetry/OTel) is a plus.</li><li>This internship is ideal for a candidate interested in building hands-on AI engineering experience, contributing to a real enterprise AI platform, and learning directly from experienced AI Engineers.</li></ul>", "title": "Qualifications"}, "companyDescription": {"text": "<p>NCS is a leading AI Tech Services company. With a 15,000-strong team across the Asia Pacific, NCS scales its platforms and capabilities to provide clients with greater agility and AI expertise across a range of Industries. Embracing a strong ecosystem of global partners, NCS transforms technology services delivery combining AI with digital resilience to drive real business impact. NCS is a subsidiary of the Singtel Group.</p>", "title": "Company Description"}, "additionalInformation": {"text": "<div sr-tagline=\\"\\"></div><p>We are driven by our AEIOU beliefs—Adventure, Excellence, Integrity, Ownership, and Unity—and we seek individuals who embody these values in both their professional and personal lives. We are committed to our Impact: Valuing our clients, Growing our people, and Creating our future.</p><p>&#xa0;</p><p>Together, we make the extraordinary happen.</p><p>&#xa0;</p><p>Learn more about us at ncs.co and visit our LinkedIn career site.</p><p>&#xa0;</p><p></p><p><u>Scam Alert</u></p><p>&#xa0;</p><p>We are aware of fraudulent job offers and impersonations of NCS recruiters. Phishing emails using convincing-looking but fake addresses are also commonly used to trick you into thinking that they come from official NCS sources.</p><p>&#xa0;</p><p>Please note that all official communications from NCS Group will only be sent from verified corporate email addresses. Always check that the sender’s email address ends with the genuine NCS domain, @ncs.com.sg and beware of extra letters, symbols or misspellings. When in doubt, verify the sender’s identity by contacting us at reachus@ncs.com.sg.</p><p></p><p></p>", "title": "Additional Information"}}}, "jobId": "87354980-65a5-4e86-b047-947fc7d37cfa", "active": true, "company": {"name": "NCS", "identifier": "NCS3"}, "creator": {"name": "", "avatarUrl": ""}, "jobAdId": "73bbebb6-d873-430b-bb77-8b5e6a264fdd", "applyUrl": "https://jobs.smartrecruiters.com/NCS3/6000000001287239--uni-jan-till-jun-2027-ai-engineer-intern?oga=true", "function": {"id": "information_technology", "label": "Information Technology"}, "industry": {"id": "it_and_services", "label": "Information Technology And Services"}, "language": {"code": "en", "label": "English", "labelNative": "English (US)"}, "location": {"city": "Singapore", "hybrid": false, "remote": false, "country": "sg", "latitude": "1.2811866", "longitude": "103.8503404", "fullLocation": "Singapore, , Singapore"}, "refNumber": "REF1711H", "department": {"id": 6000000000102340, "label": "Others"}, "postingUrl": "https://jobs.smartrecruiters.com/NCS3/6000000001287239--uni-jan-till-jun-2027-ai-engineer-intern", "visibility": "PUBLIC", "customField": [{"fieldId": "691b1a593b3befd0769aace8", "valueId": "a32d3d0f-e368-4f2a-a921-805295b10110", "fieldLabel": "Service Org", "valueLabel": "AIC"}, {"fieldId": "COUNTRY", "valueId": "sg", "fieldLabel": "Country/Region", "valueLabel": "Singapore"}, {"fieldId": "68b6fdb339264fc0afa900c8", "valueId": "default", "fieldLabel": "Brands", "valueLabel": "NCS"}, {"fieldId": "691b14303b3befd0769aace4", "valueId": "da96cac5-4ee2-48d0-bdcb-b636cc689f6e", "fieldLabel": "Employment Group", "valueLabel": "Intern"}, {"fieldId": "68b6fdb339264fc0afa900c9", "valueId": "6000000000102340", "fieldLabel": "Department", "valueLabel": "Others"}, {"fieldId": "691b1a2a2e1a5b69c566719c", "valueId": "3261017", "fieldLabel": "Centre Name", "valueLabel": "AI Factory (3261017)"}, {"fieldId": "691b19513b3befd0769aace7", "fieldLabel": "Cost Centre", "valueLabel": "200010102303"}], "referralUrl": "https://jobs.smartrecruiters.com/external-referrals/company/NCS3/publication/4522844c-7ed4-4f54-ac5b-98d4165f2492?dcr_ci=NCS3", "defaultJobAd": true, "releasedDate": "2026-08-05T07:38:03.036Z", "experienceLevel": {"id": "internship", "label": "Internship"}, "typeOfEmployment": {"id": "intern", "label": "Intern"}}	2026-09-24 16:35:52.306886+08
283	39	40	6000000001275993	[Uni – Jan till Jun 2027] Agentic AI Intern	Singapore, sg	\N	https://api.smartrecruiters.com/v1/companies/NCS3/postings/6000000001275993	active	\N	2026-09-24 16:35:52.306886+08	2026-09-24 16:35:52.306886+08	2026-09-29 01:14:57.823611+08	2026-10-13 22:25:58.720579+08	As an Agentic AI Intern, you will be part of a fast-paced team developing cutting-edge AI solutions, including generative and agentic AI applications. You will contribute to building impactful proof-of-concept (PoC) projects aligned with real client needs, and help develop reusable AI components that accelerate future solution development. This role is ideal for someone who is passionate about AI, eager to learn, and excited to apply both software engineering and machine learning skills in real-world scenarios. What You’ll Do: Role Overview: You will contribute to building generative and agentic AI applications, developing reusable AI assets that accelerate solution delivery across the company, and evaluating AI systems for safety, security, and reliability. Develop end-to-end generative AI and agentic AI applications using modern AI frameworks and full-stack technologies. Build reusable AI components such as prompt templates, evaluation pipelines, APIs, and software libraries that can be adopted across multiple projects. Perform AI risk analysis by designing and executing tests to identify issues such as hallucinations, prompt injection, data leakage, unsafe tool usage, and other vulnerabilities in AI agents. Develop automated evaluation pipelines to generate evidence of AI risks and measure the effectiveness of mitigation strategies.\n\nPassion for AI and emerging technologies, with a strong willingness to learn and adapt to new tools and frameworks. Basic programming knowledge in Python or JavaScript/TypeScript. Familiarity with software development fundamentals such as APIs, Git, and object-oriented programming. Basic understanding of Linux, Docker, or cloud technologies is a plus, but not required. Strong analytical and problem-solving skills with an interest in experimenting and building innovative AI solutions. Self-motivated team player with good communication skills and a proactive attitude.\n\nWe are driven by our AEIOU beliefs—Adventure, Excellence, Integrity, Ownership, and Unity—and we seek individuals who embody these values in both their professional and personal lives. We are committed to our Impact: Valuing our clients, Growing our people, and Creating our future. Together, we make the extraordinary happen. Learn more about us at ncs.co and visit our LinkedIn career site. Scam Alert We are aware of fraudulent job offers and impersonations of NCS recruiters. Phishing emails using convincing-looking but fake addresses are also commonly used to trick you into thinking that they come from official NCS sources. Please note that all official communications from NCS Group will only be sent from verified corporate email addresses. Always check that the sender’s email address ends with the genuine NCS domain, @ncs.com.sg and beware of extra letters, symbols or misspellings. When in doubt, verify the sender’s identity by contacting us at reachus@ncs.com.sg.	8c1086c393a5f446ccf09cbaabcffedc8c59fecb0fb12c53f59411abf2d3953a	{"id": "6000000001275993", "name": "[Uni – Jan till Jun 2027] Agentic AI Intern", "uuid": "bbeb5d5f-7135-4c8a-884c-3c34552c506f", "jobAd": {"sections": {"jobDescription": {"text": "<p>As an Agentic AI Intern, you will be part of a fast-paced team developing cutting-edge AI solutions, including generative and agentic AI applications. You will contribute to building impactful proof-of-concept (PoC) projects aligned with real client needs, and help develop reusable AI components that accelerate future solution development. This role is ideal for someone who is passionate about AI, eager to learn, and excited to apply both software engineering and machine learning skills in real-world scenarios.</p><p><strong>What You’