344	37	38	744000150014319	Intern, AI Research	Singapore, sg	\N	https://api.smartrecruiters.com/v1/companies/BoschGroup/postings/744000150014319	active	\N	2026-09-24 16:36:28.408168+08	2026-09-24 16:36:28.408168+08	2026-09-29 01:14:57.823611+08	2026-10-13 22:25:58.768128+08	💼 Role Overview We are looking for a motivated and enthusiastic individual to join Bosch for a fulfilling internship opportunity! This internship will provide valuable hands-on experience in a corporate environment, allowing you to contribute to ongoing projects while learning from experienced professionals. As a Intern, AI Research you will support the operations and learning initiatives in collaboration with experienced team members. 🎯 What you will do (Key Responsibilities) Investigate state-of-the-art methods in the field Statistical Analysis, Machine Learning, Deep Learning and/or other related AI methods for anomaly detection. Focus will be developing deep learning models on time-series data Conduct regular technical discussions to deep dive into problem statements. Support data collection and preprocessing. Propose concept using suitable methodologies to solve the pain points. Develop and validate proof-of-concept. Project updates, presentation, support demonstrations for project stakeholders.\n\n👤 What We're Looking For (Qualifications & Skills) Able to work full time for a period of 6 months (July/Aug 2026 onwards) Undergraduate/graduate studies in Computer Science, Artificial Intelligence or Engineering. Must have strong proficiency in time-series modelling and/or sequential deep learning. Proficiency in AI/ML frameworks such as TensorFlow and related libraries. Proficiency in Python and C++ and coding best practices. Strong analytical and problem-solving skills. Highly motivated and able to work independently as well as collaboratively Effective communication and presentation skills.\n\n💎 Why Intern With Us? We don’t just offer jobs—we build careers. At Bosch, you’ll benefit from: • 🧠 Real-world experience apply classroom knowledge to practical, real-life work scenarios • 📈 Skill-development build technical and soft skills while being part of the team “in-action” • 💼 Opportunities to network and learn from industry professionals • 🤝 Inclusive culture built on respect, collaboration, and empowerment 📅 Next Steps Our recruitment process typically includes: 1. Application screening 2. Interview(s) with Hiring Manager, Business Leaders and HR Ready to grow your career with Bosch? 🚀 Apply Now!	37023bbee75a324c7431d332936f0d3410ad62773747a8ca2268d7ca1595a118	{"id": "744000150014319", "name": "Intern, AI Research ", "uuid": "bfae01e6-226d-4bfc-b487-99e37833db03", "jobAd": {"sections": {"jobDescription": {"text": "<p><strong>💼 Role Overview</strong></p><p>We are looking for a motivated and enthusiastic individual to join Bosch for a fulfilling internship opportunity! This internship will provide valuable hands-on experience in a corporate environment, allowing you to contribute to ongoing projects while learning from experienced professionals. As a Intern, AI Research&#xa0;you will support the operations and learning initiatives in collaboration with experienced team members.</p><p><strong>🎯 What you will do (Key Responsibilities)</strong></p><ul><li>Investigate state-of-the-art methods in the field Statistical Analysis, Machine Learning, Deep Learning and/or other related AI methods for anomaly detection.</li><li>Focus will be developing deep learning models on time-series data</li><li>Conduct regular technical discussions to deep dive into problem statements.</li><li>Support data collection and preprocessing.</li><li>Propose concept using suitable methodologies to solve the pain points.&#xa0;</li><li>Develop and validate proof-of-concept.</li><li>Project updates, presentation, support demonstrations for project stakeholders.</li></ul><p>&#xa0;</p>", "title": "Job Description"}, "qualifications": {"text": "<p><strong>👤 What We're Looking For (Qualifications &amp; Skills)</strong></p><ul><li>Able to work full time for a period of 6 months (July/Aug 2026 onwards)</li><li>Undergraduate/graduate studies in Computer Science, Artificial Intelligence or Engineering.</li><li>Must have strong proficiency in time-series modelling and/or sequential deep learning.</li><li>Proficiency in AI/ML frameworks such as TensorFlow and related libraries.</li><li>Proficiency in Python and C++ and coding best practices.</li><li>Strong analytical and problem-solving skills.</li><li>Highly motivated and able to work independently as well as collaboratively</li><li>Effective communication and presentation skills.</li></ul>", "title": "Qualifications"}, "companyDescription": {"text": "<p><strong>🏢 About Bosch Group</strong></p><p>The Bosch Group is a leading global supplier of technology and services. It employs roughly 418,000 associates worldwide. The company generated sales of 90.3 billion euros in 2024. Its operations are divided into four business sectors: Mobility, Industrial Technology, Consumer Goods, and Energy and Building Technology. With technology that is “Invented for life,” Bosch wants to help improve quality of life and conserve natural resources. The Bosch Group comprises Robert Bosch GmbH and its roughly 490 subsidiary and regional companies in over 60 countries. At 136 locations across the globe, Bosch employs some 87,000 associates in research and development.</p><p><strong>🏢 About Robert Bosch (South East Asia)</strong></p><p>As the Bosch Group's regional headquarters in Singapore for Southeast Asia, Robert Bosch (South East Asia) Pte Ltd has represented the Group's interests across the region since 1923. With diversified businesses in Mobility Aftermarket, Industrial Technology, Consumer Goods, and Building Technology. Robert Bosch (SEA) Pte Ltd includes the Asia Pacific headquarters for Mobility Aftermarket, Building Technology, and Industrial Technology, as well as the Southeast Asia R&amp;D setup for Corporate Research, Advance Engineering Centre, and Bosch Business Innovations, Bosch's in-house innovation and startup incubation network. At Bosch, we are committed through our EVP ensuring all our associates to <strong>GROW</strong>, <strong>ENJOY</strong> and <strong>INSPIRE</strong> during their journey with us.</p>", "title": "Company Description"}, "additionalInformation": {"text": "<p><strong>💎 Why Intern With Us?</strong></p><p>We don’t just offer jobs—we build careers. At Bosch, you’ll benefit from:</p><p>• 🧠 Real-world experience apply classroom knowledge to practical, real-life work scenarios</p><p>• 📈 Skill-development build technical and soft skills while being part of the team “in-action”</p><p>• 💼 Opportunities to network and learn from industry professionals</p><p>• 🤝 Inclusive culture built on respect, collaboration, and empowerment</p><p><strong>📅 Next Steps</strong></p><p>Our recruitment process typically includes:</p><p>1. Application screening</p><p>2. Interview(s) with Hiring Manager, Business Leaders and HR</p><p>Ready to&#xa0;<strong>grow</strong>&#xa0;your career with Bosch? 🚀 Apply Now!</p>", "title": "Additional Information"}}}, "jobId": "aa830b12-75de-4a37-b506-924fa699e9ae", "active": false, "company": {"name": "Bosch Group", "identifier": "BoschGroup"}, "creator": {"name": "", "avatarUrl": ""}, "jobAdId": "3f867f5d-5814-45a9-a192-ca0a381a8ccb", "applyUrl": "https://jobs.smartrecruiters.com/BoschGroup/744000150014319-intern-ai-research-?oga=true", "function": {"id": "general_business", "label": "General Business"}, "industry": {"id": "mechanical_engineering", "label": "Mechanical Or Industrial Engineering"}, "language": {"code": "en", "label": "English", "labelNative": "English (US)"}, "location": {"city": "Singapore", "hybrid": false, "remote": false, "address": "11 Bishan Street 21", "country": "sg", "postalCode": "573943", "fullLocation": ", "}, "refNumber": "REF290206L", "postingUrl": "https://jobs.smartrecruiters.com/BoschGroup/744000150014319-intern-ai-research-", "visibility": "PUBLIC", "customField": [{"fieldId": "5abe2a4ab60a5e486a2d9b1d", "valueId": "98487475-2a49-44f5-a615-408b525b3821", "fieldLabel": "Contract type", "valueLabel": "Limited"}, {"fieldId": "5abe28e96d8bc56863dd9746", "valueId": "1d83a137-325a-48bb-97fc-61e5150a619f", "fieldLabel": "Tariff Area", "valueLabel": "Singapore Local Grades"}, {"fieldId": "586a997ee4b05fd937b86098", "valueId": "0192622d-fff4-487f-9495-6f3a7f6d33b2", "fieldLabel": "Legal Entity(acronym)", "valueLabel": "RBSI"}, {"fieldId": "586a99b5e4b0daa006ae1079", "valueId": "70deb26e-e2b9-40ca-bf95-85f5730ec04c", "fieldLabel": "Working Location", "valueLabel": "Singapore"}, {"fieldId": "5abe295a6d8bc56863dd9747", "valueId": "80ae06a1-4738-48e8-8aea-4613f58ecd57", "fieldLabel": "Global Salary Level", "valueLabel": "Others"}, {"fieldId": "69ca83a2489188782a1e9f87", "valueId": "0d8b2ae9-fc67-447b-9165-201f59f71e90", "fieldLabel": "Direct Or Indirect", "valueLabel": "Direct"}, {"fieldId": "5abe29f9b60a5e486a2d9b1c", "valueId": "60756b3e-dbab-4353-ac3a-0064d2bb27d8", "fieldLabel": "Working hours", "valueLabel": "Full-time"}, {"fieldId": "586a9995e4b0daa006ae1078", "valueId": "a584d752-f1a5-46c6-bb3a-78dfd8ddb5ff", "fieldLabel": "Legal Entity", "valueLabel": "Robert Bosch (SEA) Pte Ltd"}, {"fieldId": "691cf1c93001c782b9560ab7", "valueId": "b4e099f0-c66a-4d81-b9ce-b9d1d34e310b", "fieldLabel": "Division full name", "valueLabel": "CR"}, {"fieldId": "5abe27936d8bc56863dd9745", "valueId": "f524b939-fe55-407b-a0b0-e8f4eec28997", "fieldLabel": "Position type", "valueLabel": "Intern"}, {"fieldId": "COUNTRY", "valueId": "sg", "fieldLabel": "Country/Region", "valueLabel": "Singapore"}, {"fieldId": "586a971ee4b0daa006ae1077", "valueId": "default", "fieldLabel": "Brands", "valueLabel": "Bosch Group"}, {"fieldId": "586a996ce4b05fd937b86097", "valueId": "c5857f19-effd-4d50-aa2a-22a0adc9c809", "fieldLabel": "Working Country", "valueLabel": "Singapore"}, {"fieldId": "586a9b22e4b05fd937b8609a", "valueId": "3037ad15-7175-40aa-baf0-e4dcc6b11782", "fieldLabel": "Local Grade", "valueLabel": "SG_Intern"}, {"fieldId": "586a99a5e4b05fd937b86099", "valueId": "CR", "fieldLabel": "Division", "valueLabel": "CR"}], "referralUrl": "https://jobs.smartrecruiters.com/external-referrals/company/BoschGroup/publication/bfae01e6-226d-4bfc-b487-99e37833db03?dcr_ci=BoschGroup", "defaultJobAd": true, "releasedDate": "2026-09-17T06:03:32.674Z", "experienceLevel": {"id": "internship", "label": "Internship"}, "typeOfEmployment": {"id": "intern", "label": "Intern"}}	2026-09-24 16:36:28.408168+08
